        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana EP6125, Heavy Duty Pocket Door Edge Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of Solid Brass, this Heavy Duty Pocket Door Edge Pull is used mostly on sliding pocket doors. Pushing on the top of the pull lever flips it open so you can grab it and slide the pocket door open. It is 6-3/16\" high by1-1/4\" wide. This Solid Brass Edge Pull is <b>for use on 1-3/4\" or thicker doors</b>. Available in 12 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-EP6125-Specifications.gif?v=1704354674\" width=\"322\" height=\"338\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana EP6125 Heavy Duty Pocket Door Edge Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor doors thinner than 1-3/4\" use the <a href=\"/products/4-inch-pocket-door-edge-pull-deltana-ep475\">Standard Door Edge Pull</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana EP6125 Large Door Edge Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 6-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Holes Center to Center: 5-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Lever Opening: 138 Degrees</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" and thicker only</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EP6125.pdf?v=1704262161\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana EP6125 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>* For use on 1-3/4\" or thicker doors.</b>\r\n</p>",
