                "title": "Heavy Duty Pocket Door Edge Pull | Deltana EP6125",
                "description": "Heavy Duty Pocket Door Edge Pull, Deltana EP6125 - Made of Solid Brass, this Heavy Duty Pocket Door Edge Pull is used mostly on sliding pocket doors. Pushing on the top of the pull lever flips it open so you can grab it and slide the pocket door open. It is 6-3/16 inches high by1-1/4 inches wide. This Solid Brass Edge Pull is for use on 1-3/4 inch or thicker doors. Available in 12 finishes.",
